  <h3>What are media queries?</h3>
  <p>
    The are css selector that can style when a condition is met regarding the
    specs of device or preferences
  </p>
  <h3>What is the container selector?</h3>
  <p>
    A css selector to style for what the sizing of the parent container is
  </p>
  <h3>What is a container-style selector?</h3>
  <p>
    A way to style depending on what styling the container/parent of an element
    has
  </p>
  <h3>What are custom style property's?</h3>
  <p>
    Use var() to grab variables that dont exist and then with java script you
    can inline style on the html so that the variable does exist. keeping the
    styling in the css.
  </p>
